  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/C1/). VERDICT: CURRENT (cited lines drifted about +50). cli.py:4113 _install_embeddings_impl, :4128-4129 pip install 'sentence-transformers', 'onnxruntime' unpinned (unchanged since e64e0fbb6c); :5014 EMBEDDINGS_REQUIREMENT = 'sentence-transformers~=5.7' consumed only by cmd_install_embeddings :5063-5102 (version check + upgrade); _is_embeddings_available :5033 is import-only; _extras_components :3947-3950 wires that pair; cmd_add_extras :5207-5210 skips when row_available(). test_embeddings_requirement.py:69-76 asserts the requirement only on cmd_install_embeddings; test_extras_umbrella.py:472 asserts only 'pip' in cmd. INV-gujus (changelog) shares _fetch_embedding_models (:4143): the weights converge, the version floor does not. MECHANISM: two installers for one component; the umbrella's predicate is presence, not conformance to the requirement constant (singleton). Status unchanged."  # b69f
